    "created_at": "2023-07-23T14:33:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-23T14:33:02Z",
    "body": "Why isn't it desirable for the root element, but acceptable for other ancestors, such as the `body` element? I think I'd rather not add a special case and if people want an API for fullscreening a document we'd add a dedicated one.\r\n\r\ncc @nt1m @emilio",
