    "created_at": "2023-07-23T15:02:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-23T15:02:58Z",
    "body": "Safari's behavior matches Chrome per spec fwiw. Only Firefox special cases the root.\r\n\r\nI don't feel super strongly either way.\r\n\r\nA special case would only work for the root fwiw, since anything else in the document pushed in the top layer can potentially be overlaid by other things in the document. That is not the case for the root however, since it contains all the elements in the page.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
